@@ -0,0 +1,51 @@
+# Codex CRP Runtime
+
+## Mocked client runbook
+
+1) Build the runtime:
+
+```bash
+cargo build -p codex-crp
+```
+
+2) Run the mocked client script (from `codex-rs`):
+
+```bash
+./crp-runtime/scripts/mock_client.sh ./target/debug/codex-crp
+```
+
+This streams `session.open` -> `session.prompt` -> `session.cancel` over stdin and prints
+CRP events to stdout. The cancel is best-effort and may arrive after the model begins output.
+
+## Dummy daemon runbook
+
+1) Build the runtime:
+
+```bash
+cargo build -p codex-crp
+```
+
+2) Run the dummy daemon script (responds to tool requests):
+
+```bash
+python3 ./crp-runtime/scripts/dummy_daemon.py ./target/debug/codex-crp
+```
+
+## Dummy daemon + webapp runbook
+
+1) Start the ctx daemon (from the ctx monorepo root):
+
+```bash
+cargo run -p ctx-http --bin ctx
+```
+
+2) Start the webapp:
+
+```bash
+pnpm -C core/apps/web dev
+```
+
+3) Configure the provider command to point at the `codex-crp` binary (Settings → Providers).
+
+4) Run a sample task and confirm `tool.request`, `tool.output.delta`, and `tool.completed`
+   events appear in the session stream.
