+{"event":{"id":"fixture-turn-1","msg":{"item":{"content":[{"text":"This repo is for **ctx**, an Agentic Development Environment (ADE). It provides a local, vendor‑neutral control plane (daemon + clients) that orchestrates multiple coding agent harnesses (Codex, Claude, Gemini, etc.) over real workspaces. The daemon owns workspaces, tasks, sessions, runs/turns, and ctx Packs (specs/skills/prompts), exposing a local HTTP/WebSocket API used by desktop and mobile clients. The focus is local‑first, multi‑agent workflows with structured context, replayable activity, and remote‑workspace parity (VS Code Remote‑style).","type":"Text"}],"id":"msg_0f51e99ed8892f4b0169815d676d00819d93e5df806d13caf7","type":"AgentMessage"},"thread_id":"019c2154-48b0-78a3-afd1-2535a20d281b","turn_id":"fixture-turn-1","type":"item_completed"}},"i":703}
